--- !u!114 &1046162212
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1046162211}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a3972ca2b04e59d419d3d4d580697341, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryDialogueController
  sceneMode: 0
  heroBubble: {fileID: 231676059}
  bossBubble: {fileID: 2146000002}
  bossVisualRoot: {fileID: 769482755}
  fadeOverlay: {fileID: 1388268344}
  victoryOverlay: {fileID: 1687958375}
  openingLines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: Decades have passed... and now I have returned.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Since that day, I have lost count of the battles I have fought.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Even on the quietest nights, I have never known a moment's rest.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Today, I have finally made my choice.
  - speaker: 0
    text: I will put the past to rest.
  firstEncounterLines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: These monsters again? How familiar.
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Time has rusted my blade\u2014and weathered its wielder."
  - speaker: 0
    text: I should find equipment worthy of the road ahead.
  bossIntroductionLines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: You...?
  - speaker: 0
    text: Me. I have come to settle an old debt.
  - speaker: 1
    text: So you finally came. You never could let go of what happened.
  - speaker: 1
    text: Your lord met a truly wretched end.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Do not dare speak of him!
  - speaker: 1
    text: Ha! Whether I have the right is yours to prove in battle!
  bossVictoryLines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: You have grown stronger. All those years of battle...
  - speaker: 0
    text: You did not kill my lord! Who are you?
  - speaker: 1
    text: ...and wiser, too. Your eyes have sharpened.
  - speaker: 1
    text: You are right. It was not me. Take the crimson rune you found and seek
      the truth.
  - speaker: 0
    text: ...
  - speaker: 0
    text: Then today, at last, the truth will be revealed.
  movementPrompt: "WASD / Arrow Keys \u2014 Move"
  combatPrompt: Press J to attack. Press I to throw a kunai.
  chestPrompt: Press F to open treasure chests.
  equipmentPrompt: Press B to open the backpack, N to open the forge.
  doubleJumpPrompt: Press Space in midair to double-jump.
  dashPrompt: Press Shift while moving to dash.
